WEBVTT

00:01.290 --> 00:02.380
Teika-kun.

00:02.380 --> 00:09.690
I'll teach you a spell I used, myself, when I was with the Himemiya and was hated by my good friend.

00:09.690 --> 00:12.140
"I am alone, anyway."

00:12.140 --> 00:15.700
"I was born alone and will die alone."

00:15.700 --> 00:18.270
"So I'm not lonely. Not lonely at all."

00:18.270 --> 00:19.280
Honored Sister...

00:19.280 --> 00:23.210
Let's do it, Teika-kun. Say it with me,
and you'll simply feel better.

00:23.210 --> 00:24.520
Ready, go.

00:25.310 --> 00:27.530
Thank you for your thoughts,

00:28.250 --> 00:29.920
but I am well.

01:48.790 --> 01:51.880
Do all pigs with talent succeed? No!

01:51.880 --> 01:54.710
However pigs who have mastered an art have one similarity.

01:54.710 --> 01:56.010
And that's belief!

01:56.010 --> 01:57.740
Do you have that in you?

02:20.330 --> 02:23.190
I didn't know Shizuka-san was Lady Aichi's friend.

02:23.190 --> 02:25.600
You're one of the Momokusa men, Takahaka-san?

02:25.600 --> 02:28.860
Yes. The Momokusa have treated me well.

02:28.860 --> 02:31.600
I've known Lady Aichi since she was young, too.

02:31.600 --> 02:34.840
So, what are you doing here?

02:35.920 --> 02:37.110
Well...

02:40.240 --> 02:42.740
The baby lion that was in Madara's cage...

02:42.740 --> 02:44.350
That's Lady Aichi.

02:44.350 --> 02:45.710
What?!

02:45.710 --> 02:50.320
The Momokusa was blamed for
the beastman case and was torn down.

02:51.630 --> 02:56.860
The Momokusa personnel, however, organized themselves to create a new drug with the aim of reestablishing the group.

02:57.250 --> 03:00.960
But in the process, a handful were exposed to the drug.

03:00.960 --> 03:05.420
We leaned on the owner of the zoo to keep them until an antidote was made.

03:05.420 --> 03:07.200
And Momokusa-san's one of them?

03:07.200 --> 03:07.890
Yes.

03:08.530 --> 03:16.350
That night I was attacked by Madara, we were going to get our people out since we had an antidote ready.

03:16.350 --> 03:19.040
But instead, Madara knocked me out and took our Lady away.

03:19.890 --> 03:21.050
Damn Madara...

03:22.430 --> 03:23.820
Help us!

03:23.820 --> 03:25.350
Give us some food!

03:26.900 --> 03:33.900
You know, after becoming an animal, I kind of understand why you hate humans so much.

03:34.760 --> 03:38.070
You got in a fight with that lion because of humans, right?

03:38.450 --> 03:40.930
So I understand how you don't want to help them, too.

03:41.630 --> 03:45.870
But at this rate, the world's going to fall into a chaos.

03:46.490 --> 03:48.740
Looks like it's already beginning to.

03:50.610 --> 03:51.800
It's from the zoo.

03:52.460 --> 03:54.120
That's Shizuka's voice!

03:54.120 --> 03:55.790
Hey wait! It's dangerous!

03:59.050 --> 04:00.350
What's happening to them?

04:00.350 --> 04:01.710
The window's going to break.

04:01.710 --> 04:02.760
Takahaka-san!

04:05.240 --> 04:09.010
Stop! Stop it! Shizuka's my friend!

04:12.040 --> 04:14.600
Madara... Help me...

04:16.670 --> 04:17.730
What's going on here?

04:17.730 --> 04:18.710
Madara!

04:23.530 --> 04:24.570
Calm down!

04:25.560 --> 04:27.950
Obey me. Listen to me.

04:27.950 --> 04:29.460
I'm the king!

04:31.510 --> 04:32.500
Madara!

04:56.210 --> 05:00.750
I don't really know the details,
but if you keep everything in, you'll explode.

05:00.750 --> 05:02.050
Mother...

05:02.050 --> 05:03.030
Time for dinner.

05:03.420 --> 05:04.750
It's so good.

05:05.300 --> 05:08.310
Is it just me, or do I see a new person?

05:08.310 --> 05:10.160
Don't worry about him.

05:10.160 --> 05:13.100
An increase in the number of people is a decrease in portion size!

05:13.100 --> 05:14.250
It's a grave problem!

05:15.740 --> 05:19.320
Let go! A new face doesn't deserve bread!

05:18.020 --> 05:19.700
That's not the issue here!

05:19.700 --> 05:23.020
Dekamelon! You shouldn't be nonchalantly sitting for dinner either!

05:23.020 --> 05:23.990
My name is Mant-

05:24.510 --> 05:26.140
How noisy.

05:26.140 --> 05:30.030
You may keep eating, so explain the situation, Dekamelon.

05:30.030 --> 05:33.520
I checked around like you ordered,
but most humans have already turned into animals.

05:34.090 --> 05:38.930
However, there is one lion who's slowly taking control over animals using the power of a Bister King.

05:38.930 --> 05:39.770
Madara.

05:39.770 --> 05:42.610
Then the world would get ruled by this Madara.

05:42.610 --> 05:43.490
Ruled?

05:43.490 --> 05:49.780
The voice of Bister Kings allows us to directly influence the instinct of aninals and control them.

05:49.780 --> 05:53.490
Anyone who is ordered will be dominated without question.

05:53.490 --> 05:54.910
If that happens...

05:54.910 --> 05:56.990
Madara-san becomes the king?

05:56.990 --> 05:58.240
Bingo.

05:58.240 --> 05:59.550
I see.

06:00.890 --> 06:03.440
What would we eat if we become animals?

06:03.440 --> 06:03.880
Huh?

06:03.880 --> 06:05.780
If you don't have cake to eat, then eat bread!

06:05.780 --> 06:08.450
I wish to eat Pierre's cooking even after becoming an animal!

06:08.450 --> 06:10.800
So Pierre! You become a monkey!

06:10.800 --> 06:12.340
A monkey would be able to cook.

06:12.340 --> 06:14.350
A monkey, is it?

06:14.350 --> 06:17.680
Kyouka. This problem is about more than monkeys, bread, and cake.

06:17.680 --> 06:19.470
What are you guys even brooding over anyway?

06:19.470 --> 06:22.570
Why be so scared just because
the case is on a global level, you fool!

06:22.570 --> 06:24.690
We're just dealing with one lion.

06:25.070 --> 06:27.970
You'll be the lead player of this party!

06:27.970 --> 06:28.870
What are you saying, Kyouka?

06:28.870 --> 06:32.280
It's the Midarezaki family code to use anything that can be used to your advantage.

06:32.280 --> 06:35.760
I can't trust you much, but I'll permit you to take part in things this once.

06:35.760 --> 06:36.260
Same goes to you.

06:36.660 --> 06:40.490
If Madara takes over the world, then we'll just take it back.

06:40.490 --> 06:41.170
I call this,

06:41.170 --> 06:45.420
Human vs. Animal! Who is the Ruler of the World?

06:48.090 --> 06:52.070
Get lost from the savanna, you filthy cursed child.

06:52.070 --> 06:53.680
Stay away from Shakuya!

06:54.930 --> 06:58.120
You're that scared of me?

06:59.170 --> 07:00.440
Of course you are.

07:00.930 --> 07:04.780
You guys went as far as throwing me off a cliff when I was just born.

07:07.400 --> 07:13.450
Did you know? Shakuya said he'll beat you all one day to create a new kingdom.

07:13.800 --> 07:16.860
A kingdom where everyone will be treated fairly.

07:23.630 --> 07:25.380
You're actually kind, aren't you, Madara?

07:25.380 --> 07:26.750
Huh? What's that?

07:26.750 --> 07:28.670
You saved me twice.

07:28.670 --> 07:31.930
Because I had to. I didn't do it because I wanted to.

07:32.810 --> 07:36.390
I'd be happy to see you become the king.

07:36.390 --> 07:39.530
I don't have what it takes to become the king.

07:39.530 --> 07:41.520
Well, let's get this started.

07:49.280 --> 07:50.360
Obey me!

07:50.360 --> 07:51.120
I refuse!

07:53.570 --> 07:54.380
Obey me!

07:54.380 --> 07:55.110
I refuse!

07:55.510 --> 07:57.270
You! The white one roaring up there!

07:57.270 --> 07:59.700
What? You coward! Show yourself!

07:59.700 --> 08:02.900
Who are you calling a coward?
You're just a big cat. Stop acting so cocky!

08:02.900 --> 08:04.580
You see a building in front of you, right?

08:04.580 --> 08:08.960
A beautiful girl who can be said to be the world's mystery is standing there, so search for her!

08:08.260 --> 08:08.960
What?

08:09.960 --> 08:11.860
Right here!

08:12.760 --> 08:14.650
Why do I have to take part in this?

08:14.650 --> 08:16.180
Just live with it, Dekamelon.

08:16.180 --> 08:16.980
What's that about?

08:16.980 --> 08:18.890
I'm the humans' representative, Kyouka-sama!

08:18.890 --> 08:21.770
You're the animals' representative, Madara, right?

08:21.770 --> 08:23.590
W-W-W-What?! Representative?!

08:23.590 --> 08:28.070
I know you're trying to convert all humans into animals to create a new world.

08:28.070 --> 08:30.340
I admit that you have a great idea.

08:30.340 --> 08:35.180
However! Is it really for the animals' sake to be dominated by you?

08:35.180 --> 08:36.820
Wh-What do you mean by that?

08:36.820 --> 08:39.300
You're not the only Bister King alive.

08:39.300 --> 08:43.280
If given a choice, animals would want to be dominated by the king who would bring a better life;

08:43.280 --> 08:46.460
the king they wish to be ruled by, don't you think?

08:46.460 --> 08:47.810
Are you talking about Shakuya?

08:47.810 --> 08:49.960
Your and Teika's ideals are not compatible!

08:50.460 --> 08:53.970
What you wish for is a world composed of only animals and no humans.

08:53.970 --> 08:58.110
However, our representative, Teika,
wishes for a world dominated by humans!

08:58.110 --> 08:59.100
That can't be true!

08:59.100 --> 09:01.080
It's what Teika wishes for.

09:01.080 --> 09:02.430
No matter what you say!

09:03.870 --> 09:08.200
We will now start a global election for the animals!

09:08.200 --> 09:08.960
Election?

09:08.960 --> 09:13.610
Ask the animalized humans around you, and they'll tell you what an election is.

09:14.830 --> 09:20.020
A week from today, you will present to the animals how great it is to be dominated by animals.

09:20.020 --> 09:22.420
We will present how great it is to be dominated by humans.

09:22.420 --> 09:26.850
In the end, the one who gets more support will become the world's dominator!

09:26.850 --> 09:30.790
Come up with doctrines that will be appealing to animals.

09:30.790 --> 09:34.090
Play a game of politics,
and humans can be extremely sneaky.

09:37.920 --> 09:41.370
I will save the Lady no matter what it takes.

09:41.960 --> 09:43.140
Takahaka-san.

09:46.090 --> 09:48.440
Listen, you need to make an antidote.

09:48.440 --> 09:49.970
I do?

09:49.970 --> 09:51.760
I brought you here for that purpose.

09:51.760 --> 09:53.720
Spider, explain it to him.

09:53.720 --> 09:54.610
Hokay.

09:54.610 --> 10:01.120
The other day, a Momokusa truck was attacked by someone and fell into the river.

10:01.120 --> 10:05.160
In it was the new drug that was developed.

10:05.160 --> 10:11.760
We believe the cause of animalization is the water reaching the ocean, evaporating, and eventually coming down as rain.

10:11.760 --> 10:12.910
One week.

10:12.910 --> 10:18.400
Using this one week Kyouka-chan bought for us, come up with a plan to distribute the antidote to the entire world.

10:18.400 --> 10:21.640
Sorry to interrupt, but I have something to ask of you, too.

10:22.380 --> 10:25.680
Why do I have a bad feeling about this?

10:26.860 --> 10:28.450
Let's keep it moving.

10:28.450 --> 10:31.950
Looks like there's nothing we can help with.

10:32.360 --> 10:35.740
You don't want to fight with your friend, do you?

10:37.250 --> 10:41.100
Teika-kun, if you don't want to, you should say so.

10:41.100 --> 10:46.350
My skills as a Bister King are essential for the election, Honored Sister.

10:46.350 --> 10:48.100
You shouldn't take it upon yourself like that.

10:48.100 --> 10:51.500
You're strong, so you're always doing that.

10:51.500 --> 10:53.630
True, I am taking it upon myself.

10:53.630 --> 10:55.930
If possible, I don't want to fight Madara.

10:56.320 --> 11:03.120
However, if all animals get dominated by Madara, this Midarezaki family won't be left alone.

11:03.520 --> 11:06.740
I once lost my family to a pointless fight.

11:06.740 --> 11:09.410
I don't want to lose another one.

11:09.410 --> 11:11.840
Then promise me this one thing.

11:11.840 --> 11:12.690
What is it?

11:14.570 --> 11:18.280
When everything's done, you have to be friends with Madara-san again.

11:18.870 --> 11:19.760
I will.

11:20.450 --> 11:25.280
But he was pretty furious,
so he might bite me if I suggest that.

11:26.180 --> 11:28.660
Th-Then I'll protect you!

11:28.660 --> 11:32.040
If Madara tries to bite you, I'll protect you!

11:33.130 --> 11:36.040
I'm not that reliable, am I?

11:37.670 --> 11:38.550
You are.

11:39.150 --> 11:40.920
Thank you, Honored Sister.

11:48.560 --> 11:50.270
Let's get this show on the road!

11:50.270 --> 11:50.990
Wait!

11:51.990 --> 11:53.560
Where is Shakuya?!

11:53.560 --> 11:59.010
Unless I hear Shakuya say he wants the humans to dominate, I can't trust you!

11:59.010 --> 12:00.640
I guess you have a point.

12:00.640 --> 12:03.490
Then let's ask the other lead for this event to show up.

12:03.490 --> 12:05.780
He's right here, right now!

12:05.780 --> 12:08.510
He's inside Ouka!

12:09.490 --> 12:14.750
Using the latest in human technology,
we've folded up Teika and are hiding him in there!

12:14.750 --> 12:22.030
However, if I call Teika's name, he will expand and rip through Ouka's body to appear in front of us!

12:21.030 --> 12:23.170
Wait Kyouka! You have to be joking!

12:22.360 --> 12:24.230
Come out, Teika!

12:24.230 --> 12:27.890
Rip through Ouka like in monster and alien movies!

12:26.320 --> 12:30.810
I don't want to die from that kind of effect!

12:30.810 --> 12:34.200
Father, what are you crying about?

12:35.510 --> 12:37.370
You idiot! You actually fell for it!

12:38.420 --> 12:41.580
I'm going to become the king you wanted to be.

12:41.580 --> 12:44.150
If you want to become a king, then be one...

12:44.150 --> 12:45.860
...if that is what you wish for.

12:45.860 --> 12:49.920
Shakuya! Don't you want to become the king of all the animals?

12:49.920 --> 12:52.780
If you become the king, you don't have to obey humans!

12:52.780 --> 12:54.610
I don't remember obeying them.

12:54.610 --> 12:57.450
I don't remember becoming like cattle for them.

12:57.450 --> 12:59.370
Humans and I are family.

12:59.370 --> 13:02.270
We are a pack that can walk together and get along.

13:02.270 --> 13:04.380
We can coexist!

13:04.380 --> 13:06.010
Don't you understand that?

13:06.010 --> 13:07.290
It's impossible!

13:07.290 --> 13:09.710
Forget all of this! Let's get started!

13:09.710 --> 13:10.310
All right.

13:10.910 --> 13:16.230
After we both finish giving our speeches,
we'll simultaneously gather our supporters.

13:16.230 --> 13:19.460
The one who gathers more will become the world's dominator.

13:19.460 --> 13:20.870
That's nice and simple.

13:20.870 --> 13:22.820
I'll go first then.

13:23.330 --> 13:25.110
Dear ex-humans!

13:25.110 --> 13:27.490
I bet you're all standing at the bottom of the pit!

13:28.190 --> 13:33.320
That's all due to humans destroying nature!

13:33.320 --> 13:37.580
However it is too late to ask for humans to take responsibility!

13:34.000 --> 13:37.170
That's a very good speaker.

13:37.170 --> 13:39.830
For an animal, there's a pretty good heart in there.

13:37.580 --> 13:43.250
Since there is no hope to turn back into humans,
let's live proudly as animals!

13:43.250 --> 13:46.170
That concludes my speech as the representative of the animals!

13:48.930 --> 13:49.840
What now?

13:49.840 --> 13:51.730
It's your turn next.

13:51.730 --> 13:54.520
Don't rush. We have a little thing to take care of first.

13:55.600 --> 14:00.060
I'm linking my Cellphone to your skill as a Bister King.

14:00.060 --> 14:03.110
Otherwise the animals won't understand what I'm saying.

14:04.370 --> 14:05.530
You guys!

14:05.530 --> 14:07.570
If you vote for me,

14:07.570 --> 14:10.890
I'll let you eat a stomach-full!

14:12.980 --> 14:18.690
I bet you're all very hungry right now since you all suddenly became animals and don't know how to get food, right?

14:18.690 --> 14:22.090
So I'll provide you with food!

14:22.090 --> 14:26.050
Support the representative of the humans, Midarezaki Kyouka, please.

14:26.050 --> 14:30.200
Kyouka, this looks familiar.

14:30.200 --> 14:39.590
Last time, it was on the southern island on our honeymoon when the white monkeys ate Nishikura-san's delicious dinner.

14:37.640 --> 14:40.140
Why do I have to do this?

14:40.460 --> 14:43.650
Dr. Gebok. Please get started.

14:43.650 --> 14:45.270
Righty-o.

14:48.070 --> 14:52.950
If you support the humans,
I will promise a life without hunger!

14:52.950 --> 14:56.830
Mom's saying that, but will it really be all right?

14:56.830 --> 15:00.930
It's undoubtedly impossible to gather enough food for all the animals.

15:01.330 --> 15:03.670
Yuuka-chan, it's called a public stance.

15:03.670 --> 15:04.730
A public stance?

15:04.730 --> 15:05.810
In other words, a lie.

15:06.680 --> 15:11.820
The animals won't know that what we're distributing right now is this empire's entire emergency stock.

15:11.820 --> 15:14.810
But it's simply wrong to tell a lie.

15:14.810 --> 15:19.690
That's a wonderful stance,
but it all depends on the time and situation.

15:20.470 --> 15:21.970
This is cheating!

15:21.970 --> 15:23.480
Aren't you ashamed of yourself?

15:23.480 --> 15:24.820
No, not at all.

15:24.820 --> 15:25.730
All that matters is the victory!

15:25.730 --> 15:29.280
Shakuya! Do you really consider someone like that your family?

15:29.280 --> 15:31.410
An unfair, shrewd creature like that?

15:32.390 --> 15:35.830
I think that was a little unfair, Mother.

15:36.680 --> 15:40.660
Even if it means cheating, humans protect their family!

15:41.920 --> 15:47.450
Madara. A world dominated by animals is an old fairytale.

15:47.910 --> 15:53.670
Isn't the future left for us to live with the humans?

15:53.670 --> 15:55.580
How can I discard my honor and live-

15:55.580 --> 15:57.160
Just because we were so proud!

15:58.330 --> 16:02.960
Just because we cared about pride so much, our clan died off.

16:02.960 --> 16:06.360
I don't want to repeat something like that ever again.

16:06.360 --> 16:07.880
Shakuya...

16:10.280 --> 16:11.030
Madara!

16:18.350 --> 16:19.110
Kyouka!

16:19.110 --> 16:20.030
Madara!

16:20.030 --> 16:22.110
Can you guys promise?!

16:22.110 --> 16:23.990
Promise not to betray Shakuya?!

16:23.990 --> 16:26.210
Promise not to sadden him again?!

16:26.210 --> 16:27.240
Madara?

16:27.610 --> 16:29.710
Shakuya lost his family.

16:29.710 --> 16:35.470
I don't want to hear that sad roar ever again.

16:35.470 --> 16:38.050
Madara... You were...

16:38.340 --> 16:42.130
I promise we won't repeat the tragedy the Bister Kings went through.

16:42.130 --> 16:44.280
Teika is this Kyouka-sama's son.

16:44.280 --> 16:47.390
He's destined to become happier than anyone on Earth.

16:47.390 --> 16:49.040
And how's this?

16:49.040 --> 16:53.240
We'll pass a law that says from now on,
in the Great Japanese Empire,

16:53.240 --> 16:56.130
all animals are allowed to walk freely on the streets and live anywhere they wish.

16:56.610 --> 16:57.500
Mother!

16:57.500 --> 16:57.990
Kyouka?

16:57.990 --> 17:03.250
First of all, I'm here as the representative of humans, but I'm not a human; I'm a god.

17:03.250 --> 17:06.640
A city with only humans is boring.

17:06.640 --> 17:09.250
Let's change this world while we're at it.

17:09.250 --> 17:15.290
Could... Could such a dream...
A world where humans and animals can coexist...

17:16.130 --> 17:17.390
Madara!

17:17.390 --> 17:19.140
Give the Lady back to us!

17:23.890 --> 17:25.770
That stupid Madara!

17:33.070 --> 17:34.790
I'm human again.

17:50.100 --> 17:51.210
Shakuya...

17:51.680 --> 17:52.830
Shakuya?

17:54.130 --> 17:55.780
No, this can't be true.

17:56.340 --> 18:00.110
Why?! Why did you save me?!

18:00.450 --> 18:05.480
You saved my life. Did I repay it a bit?

18:05.480 --> 18:06.790
Shakuya...

18:06.790 --> 18:07.980
You were always...

18:07.980 --> 18:10.080
I'm sorry, Shakuya.

18:11.480 --> 18:13.230
Here I am.

18:13.230 --> 18:14.980
Here to solve everything.

18:15.770 --> 18:17.110
Who are you?

18:26.600 --> 18:27.620
You're...

18:28.510 --> 18:30.880
You're going to save Shakuya?

18:30.880 --> 18:33.220
Can't you tell by looking, white one?

18:33.220 --> 18:35.230
Don't just stare and help me.

18:35.800 --> 18:37.900
It's like a blood transfusion.

18:37.900 --> 18:42.270
I'll use some of your vitality.

18:43.300 --> 18:47.310
Teika, you've faced your pain without running away.

18:47.900 --> 18:54.150
You spoke your honest heart and protected your precious friend without worrying about your own well-being.

18:54.150 --> 18:56.710
Nothing changes when holding things within,

18:56.710 --> 19:01.530
but I guess there are things that can change by taking action without fear of being hurt.

19:03.910 --> 19:12.690
Madara. This might not be of any importance now,
but if you wish, the Bister King bloodline may live on.

19:12.690 --> 19:13.980
What do you mean?

19:13.980 --> 19:15.670
It's simple.

19:15.670 --> 19:19.170
Cease deceiving yourself.

19:30.690 --> 19:33.330
Oh, you're back as human, as well.

19:34.110 --> 19:35.630
Father?

19:36.020 --> 19:37.150
Shiruku!

19:40.400 --> 19:42.250
Hentai!

19:41.360 --> 19:44.440
Wait, Shiruku! We were animals until a moment ago!

19:42.250 --> 19:46.120
Hentai! Hentai! Hentai!

19:44.440 --> 19:45.520
You've got it wrong!

19:47.740 --> 19:52.670
Thanks to the new law passed by Kyouka-chan, the world looks different now.

19:52.670 --> 19:54.950
But the case is solved.

19:54.950 --> 19:57.710
Although, our melon bread supplies are depleted.

19:57.710 --> 20:04.390
Thanks to Dr. Gebok's antidote rain,
human animalization has pretty much ceased.

20:04.390 --> 20:06.680
In any case, thank you for your help.

20:08.300 --> 20:09.810
Here they are, Madara-san.

20:10.380 --> 20:12.230
Honored Sister. Madara.

20:13.670 --> 20:17.840
Teika-kun. I asked Madara-san not to bite you.

20:17.840 --> 20:19.840
Make sure you make up.

20:19.840 --> 20:20.900
Honored Sister...

20:27.770 --> 20:28.620
You know...

20:29.260 --> 20:32.120
Don't you think I've changed?

20:33.400 --> 20:34.500
Gosh...

20:35.530 --> 20:37.340
You can go now, Hakushaku.

20:45.640 --> 20:50.600
Hakushaku. I was wondering where you had gone, but that is where you have been.

20:51.910 --> 20:54.120
We'll talk again sometime else.

20:54.120 --> 20:57.610
For now, the third wheel shall disappear.

20:59.440 --> 21:01.440
Thank you, Hakushaku!

21:02.200 --> 21:04.000
So, what do you think, Shakuya?

21:04.000 --> 21:05.070
"What" what?

21:05.070 --> 21:05.950
Hey.

21:06.510 --> 21:07.540
That hurt.

21:07.540 --> 21:10.000
It hurts, eh? Good, now take a good look.

21:14.720 --> 21:18.210
Madara! Did you lose your hair from stress or something?!

21:18.210 --> 21:22.080
You still don't get it?! I never had a mane to begin with!

21:22.080 --> 21:22.810
Huh?

21:29.720 --> 21:31.940
WH-WHAT?!

21:31.940 --> 21:33.730
Y-Y-You were a female?!

21:34.620 --> 21:37.230
So, what do you think?

21:37.230 --> 21:38.150
Think of what?

21:38.150 --> 21:41.730
You trash! Thick-skulled nut!
I'm asking you what you think of me!

21:42.650 --> 21:44.800
Even if you ask me that all of a sudden...

21:43.330 --> 21:44.770
You seriously never noticed?

21:44.800 --> 21:45.750
Never once?

21:45.750 --> 21:47.030
Never thought of me as special?

21:47.030 --> 21:48.300
Answer me!

21:48.300 --> 21:48.990
I can't...

21:48.990 --> 21:50.070
I can't take this!

21:50.070 --> 21:51.160
Wait!

21:53.660 --> 21:55.160
Hey!

21:58.170 --> 21:59.940
Wait!

22:02.860 --> 22:08.430
Teika-kun, you've got to answer a girl's heart, do you hear?

23:40.810 --> 23:42.900
Dad, don't die!

23:42.900 --> 23:45.180
Keep it down. He's only sick.

23:45.180 --> 23:47.590
He'll be fine after eating something nutritional and some sleep.

23:47.590 --> 23:48.860
Rather than that, Yuuka.

23:49.190 --> 23:49.820
What?

23:49.820 --> 23:52.470
Next time: The Correct Way to Nurse.
